Thought: Test a weighted combination using softmax over inverse-error on the full model pool to see if a smoother weighting improves over plain inverse-error, given high correlation and unstable ranking.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: The series has unstable ranking and strong seasonality; try a per‑horizon top‑k mean on the full pool to capture horizon‑specific strengths.  
